# Line endings.
#
# index.html was the only CRLF file in an otherwise all-LF repo. An ordinary
# ten-line edit to it silently rewrote all 620 lines to LF, turning a small
# change into a 1248-line diff and costing the file its blame history. The
# repo is now consistently LF; this pins that so a stray editor or script
# can't reintroduce the inconsistency.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binary assets byte-exact.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
